## Visualizing Count Data: `geom_bar()`

::: {.panel-tabset}
### Plot

::: {.cell layout-align="center"}
::: {.cell-output-display}
![](lab_04_files/figure-revealjs/unnamed-chunk-55-1.svg){fig-align='center' width=576}
:::
:::


### Code

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
major_data |>
  ggplot(aes(x = major)) +
  geom_bar() +
  theme_classic(base_size = 14) +
  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 15, vjust = .7))
```
